@startuml MyEPortfolio_ComponentDiagram
skinparam componentStyle uml2
skinparam wrapWidth 200
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

title MyE-Portfolio — Detailed Component Diagram

package "Frontend" {
  [Inertia.js + React UI]
}

package "Backend" {
  [AdminController]
  [Api\\AuthController]
  [Auth\\PasswordResetController]
  [Auth\\WebAuthController]
  [DashboardController]
  [EducationController]
  [PortfolioController]
  [ProfileController]
  [ProjectController]
  [SkillController]
  [TemplateController]
}

package "Database" {
  interface users
  interface profiles
  interface educations
  interface skills
  interface projects
  interface templates
  interface portfolios
  interface engagement_statistics
}

' Frontend <-> Backend
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [AdminController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [Api\\AuthController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [Auth\\PasswordResetController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [Auth\\WebAuthController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [DashboardController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [EducationController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [PortfolioController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [ProfileController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [ProjectController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [SkillController] : HTTP request
[Inertia.js + React UI] --> [TemplateController] : HTTP request

[AdminController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[Api\\AuthController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[Auth\\PasswordResetController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[Auth\\WebAuthController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[DashboardController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[EducationController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[PortfolioController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[ProfileController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[ProjectController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[SkillController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()
[TemplateController] ..> [Inertia.js + React UI] : Inertia::render()

' Backend <-> Database
[AdminController] --> users : reads/writes
[AdminController] --> portfolios : reads
[AdminController] --> templates : reads/writes

[Api\\AuthController] --> users : reads/writes

[Auth\\PasswordResetController] --> users : reads/writes

[Auth\\WebAuthController] --> users : reads/writes

[DashboardController] --> profiles : reads
[DashboardController] --> educations : reads
[DashboardController] --> skills : reads
[DashboardController] --> projects : reads
[DashboardController] --> portfolios : reads
[DashboardController] --> engagement_statistics : reads

[EducationController] --> educations : reads/writes

[PortfolioController] --> portfolios : reads/writes

[ProfileController] --> profiles : reads/writes

[ProjectController] --> projects : reads/writes

[SkillController] --> skills : reads/writes

[TemplateController] --> templates : reads
[TemplateController] --> portfolios : reads/writes

@enduml
